+Fix the lam2 sweep range in validate_burn.py: it should go from 0.001 to 0.5, not 0.001 to 0.1. Use lam2_values = np.logspace(np.log10(0.001), np.log10(0.5), 60) so it actually covers the first depolarization null at lam2=pi/10≈0.314 and the pi/20≈0.157 check point.
